{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11114090","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11114090","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1111409001:0":{"text":"Divines above... I confess that I have stolen my neighbor's terrabird eggs... and also made his roof leak...","source_cn":"神明大人……我承认，我偷过邻居家的陆行鸟蛋……他家房顶...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x33332985CD3EF799","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1111409002:0":{"text":"I was wrong, but please... I beg of you... Don't deprive me of the right to stay at the Dusk Lord's side...","source_cn":"还请您……千万别剥夺我去残阳神身边的资格啊！我愿意认错……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1A24F5FED8D92071","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1111409003:0":{"text":"He's rambling... His injuries are serious, and his brain seems to have suffered damage too.","source_cn":"胡言乱语……他看着伤得不轻，脑子都受影响了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x990ED0F6EEB9BFF7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1111409004:1":{"text":"He is at his limit and needs to take this.","source_cn":"这位叔叔很虚弱，他需要吃下这个。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5CFE9BC9CD57BBF6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:8:1111409004":{"text":"He is at his limit and needs to take this.","source_cn":"这位叔叔很虚弱，他需要吃下这个。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5CFE9BC9CD57BBF6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1111409005:1":{"text":"It's food.","source_cn":"是能吃的东西。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x470D6929922E5C6A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1111409006:0":{"text":"Wait! A ball of muddy grass like that is only going to make him worse!","source_cn":"等等！这东西像混着泥巴捏成的草团，人吃了要出事的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE59AB2AE0F01BC3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1111409007:0":{"text":"Antandra taught me how to make this! Not only will it fill his stomach, but it'll also purge his body of any toxins!","source_cn":"这可是安丹姐姐教我做的团子！不止能填饱肚子，还能解毒治病呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x19825E653DCA932C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1111409008:1":{"text":"She's right, Satrana. I learned this recipe from a kind old man who I met during my travels.","source_cn":"萨忒娜，我在旅途中遇到过一位老先生，这团子是他教我做的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDF36DB8CD9C9B960","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1111409009:1":{"text":"It's made from a special red clay mixed with certain herbs, and is meant to be used for emergencies.","source_cn":"用特殊的细腻红土混合草药搓制而成，在情况紧急的时候能派...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFE69751113794EC9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1111409010:1":{"text":"Is this really okay...?","source_cn":"真的没问题吗……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBAF31FCD1FE45A14","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1111409011:1":{"text":"See, Antandra? She doesn't trust you at all!","source_cn":"安丹姐姐，你看，萨忒娜不相信你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF64A9AEEBF27257B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1111409012:1":{"text":"That's not what I meant! Antandra is too trusting of other people; who's to say that this old man was telling the truth?","source_cn":"我不是这个意思！我是怀疑那位来历不明的老先生，谁叫安丹...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6995F3332BB70EDD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1111409013:1":{"text":"I've taken this before, Satrana. It's perfectly safe, I promise.","source_cn":"我自己也曾服用过这团子，很安全。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE39A6E5D332D5B9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1111409014:1":{"text":"Fine, if you say so...","source_cn":"好吧，既然你都这么说了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3CB4EC1C9948CE07","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1111409015:1":{"text":"I'll give it to him! Am I doing this right, Antandra?","source_cn":"我喂叔叔吃下团子咯！安丹姐姐，我是不是做得很好？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1CFB08B9FBCC61C8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1111409016:1":{"text":"Well done, Koko. It looks like you're capable of taking good care of others now.","source_cn":"卡卡已经是能够照顾别人的大孩子了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x24744A4BA927E4FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1111409017:1":{"text":"Heehee! Antandra praised me again!","source_cn":"嘿嘿！安丹姐姐又夸我啦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x918788B89B8E94E1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1111409018:0":{"text":"...Hmph.","source_cn":"……哼。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE03C0C9504D33BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:27:1111409019:0":{"text":"A short while later...","source_cn":"一段时间后……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9FE836DB92391A38","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1111409020:0":{"text":"Are you feeling better now?","source_cn":"现在感觉好些了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1CB6B10031532659","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1111409021:1":{"text":"I never expected... to wake up and see such a beautiful face looking down at me... Tell me, did the divines send you to rescue me, my fair lady?","source_cn":"没想到……一睁开眼，竟然能看到你这般美丽的女性……是神...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCE76E1165EA56738","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1111409022:1":{"text":"Let go! Don't you dare touch her!","source_cn":"拿开你的手！不准摸她！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x85FA181250F870D1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1111409023:1":{"text":"Ah! I-I'm sorry... I couldn't help myself just now...","source_cn":"哎哟！对、对不起……我这是情不自禁……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD7CD357B29B1E73C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1111409024:1":{"text":"It's fine... If you're feeling better, then hurry up and leave. We don't have time to keep you company right now.","source_cn":"行了行了……你要是已经恢复了，就赶快离开这里，我们忙着...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9278C5A6E64842BE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1111409025:1":{"text":"Wait... You plan to keep going further? Don't you know how dangerous it is in there?!","source_cn":"什么……你们还要向深处走吗？太危险了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE141372CB3750108","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1111409026:1":{"text":"We have to keep going.","source_cn":"我们必须前进。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x07DC449067AF61CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1111409027:1":{"text":"Even if you manage to resist the hallucinations... You won't make it past the Webbed Wall, or the bloodthirsty spiders that made them! They'll eat you alive!","source_cn":"就算你们能抵抗那些幻觉……也根本不可能走过蛛网戈壁！那...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x08188885E490C2AD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1111409028:1":{"text":"Spiders? ... Understood. Thank you for the warning.","source_cn":"蜘蛛吗……知道了，感谢你的提醒。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x62E22A669D200D7B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1111409029:1":{"text":"You really are going, aren't you? Please, just be careful around those spiders!","source_cn":"啊……你们真的要去吗？千万要当心那些蜘蛛！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC8A69F93A074B22F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:8:0:1":{"text":"What is it?","source_cn":"那是什么？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF4E7DF0F52CA4FBB","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"What is it?","female":"What is it?","variant_male_record_index":"63692","variant_female_record_index":"63693","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:意识不清的劳工":{"text":"Dazed Laborer","source":"意识不清的劳工","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:萨忒娜":{"text":"Satrana","source":"萨忒娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:卡卡":{"text":"Koko","source":"卡卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:安丹德拉":{"text":"Antandra","source":"安丹德拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:旁白":{"text":"Narrator","source":"旁白","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:恢复意识的劳工":{"text":"Conscious Laborer","source":"恢复意识的劳工","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":32,"localized_text_count":31,"speaker_count":6}}